Only the icons Microweb uses are copied here, unmodified. {% icon %}
(core/templatetags/icon.py) inlines them, so they are not static files. To add
one, copy icons/<name>.svg from this same release. The sprite-to-icon mapping
is in .scratch/bootstrap5/issues/13-icons.md.

Added for the Color mode toggle (BS5-06): sun-fill, moon-stars-fill,
circle-half, check2.
